\par\par \b \uc2  Japan has no intention of driving yen lower-MoF official. \b0\par\par\uc2 219 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 17 Mai 2002\par 12:34\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2002 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  LONDON, May 17 (Reuters) - Japan has no intention of driving the yen artificially lower, a senior \b \highlight22\uc2 Ministry of Finance\b0 \highlight\uc2  official said on Friday. \par \par \uc2  "They (the government and the BoJ) clearly reject the idea of resorting to a beggar-thy-neighbour \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  policy of driving the yen artificially lower," Masahiro Kawai, deputy Vice Minister for Intenational Finance at the \b \highlight22\uc2 Ministry of Finance\b0 \highlight\uc2  said, according the text of his speech. \par \par \uc2  Kawai, told a conference organised by ratings agency Fitch, that the yen's slide from October to January had been a market driven phenomenon reflecting Japan's fundamentals. "It is not a result of the authorities' deliberate manipulation to push the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  value down. Indeed the government and the Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Japan\b0 \highlight\uc2  has avoided \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  market \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  expect for the very brief period immediately after the September 11 event." \par \par \uc2  The yen has recovered in recent months making traders nervous that the authorities will step in to prevent it damaging export sales. \par \par \uc2  "When the economy begins to recover the yen is expected to appreciate because of its long standing strong external position. After all, Japan has persistent current account surpluses and is one of the largest net creditor nations in the world. Therefore a weak yen will not continue indefinitely," he said. \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020020517dy5h00lbi\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
