ors showed managers scaling back on U.S. equities, to 48 percent from 49 percent in the previous month. Same managers modestly added to holdings of euro zone assets. Highlights greenback's central quandary over whether capital flows will be sufficent to offset massive U.S. current account deficit. \par \par \uc2  - Stocks open higher after Monday marked longest losing streak in 19 months. Dow Jones Industrial Average opens 20 points in the black, Nasdaq Technology average gains 1 point. \par \par \uc2  For full report on major \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020020430dy4u00rsa\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
